# A local run needs no secrets. The agent generates the gateway's SWH_AUTH_TOKEN
# per run and hands it to consumers as the secret "token" value of the warehouse
# configuration group — nothing to set here.
# For deployment, bind SWH_AUTH_TOKEN and each consumer's warehouse.token to
# the same environment-managed Kubernetes secret key (see agent README).
# Deployed environments reach a cloud warehouse through a workload identity, not
# a credential file.
